WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
During my college days,

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.800
I really enjoyed helping other students with their technical projects.

3
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.200
Since I was a self-taught programmer,

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.500
some of my classmates came to me when they were getting stuck with their project.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Then I would help them to realize the actual problem,

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.200
instead of giving them the right solution.

7
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:29.500
And I really enjoyed creating this kind of collaborative learning environment.
